# Build-time secrets injected via BuildConfig.
#
# Copy to `secrets.properties` (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# Every key here is optional until the feature that consumes it ships, so a
# clean checkout builds without this file.
#
# Phase 4 (opt-in Google Drive sync) will consume:
#   GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID  — OAuth 2.0 Web client ID from Google Cloud Console.
#                             Register SHA-1 fingerprints for BOTH the debug
#                             keystore and Play App Signing before use.
#
# Note: an OAuth client ID is not a confidential secret (it ships in the APK
# regardless), but it is environment-specific, so it is configured rather than
# hardcoded. Never put a client *secret* in an Android app.

GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
